				<h2 class="c-report__subheading">
					Texas Methodist Foundation<br />
					2023 Impact Report
				</h2>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- HEADING BLOCK -->
<section class="c-block pt-0">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row justify-content-center">
			<div class="col-12 col-md-10 col-lg-8 text-center">
				<h2 class="c-report__subheading">
					A message from President Lisa Greenwood
				</h2>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- MEDIA BLOCK -->
<section class="c-block pt-0">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col">
				<div class="js-fitvids">
					<iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/893399534?h=dfd20b0739&amp;app_id=122963" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" title="A Christmas Blessing from Rev. Lisa Greenwood" name="fitvid0"></iframe>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- GENERAL BLOCK -->
<section class="c-block pt-0">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row justify-content-center">
			<div class="col-12 col-md-10 col-lg-8 lead">
				<p>Dear Friends,</p>
				<p>On behalf of Texas Methodist Foundation, I’d like to share with you stories of impact, impact that we are making together, emboldening thriving congregations and nurturing flourishing communities for the world God imagines, grown in cultures of purpose, generosity, and courage.</p>
				<p>Each story in this report represents many other similar stories of impact. They include stories of child development centers improving the well-being of entire communities, a church embracing “all the wrong people,” churches knowing and loving their neighbors, launching leaders and innovators bringing new beginnings for congregations and communities across the country. Each story embodies what’s possible when we follow Christ, expressing love and a generous spirit.</p>
				<p>All the stories of impact are also your stories, because they are made possible by your partnership. So, when you or your congregation opens an investment account, takes out a loan, or establishes an endowment, you’re not only supporting your local church, you’re also supporting the larger work of strengthening the Methodist witness across the spiritual landscape today.</p>
				<p>Thank you for partnering with us to do the loving work of Christ in the world, investing in bold new solutions as together we steward potential toward the world God imagines.</p>
				<p>By the grace of God, may it be so!</p>
				<p class="c-report__signature">Rev. Lisa Greenwood</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- HEADING BLOCK -->
<section class="c-block pb-0">
