<!-- FACTOID -->
<section class="c-block c-factoid c-block--no-padding-bottom">
	<div class="container-fluid px-0">
		<div class="row align-items-center g-0">
			<div class="col-12 col-lg-6 d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-lg-start order-lg-2">
				<div class="c-factoid__description end">
					<div>
						<h2 class="c-factoid__heading mb-4">
							<span class="u-font-script-alt text-secondary">Investing</span> in Children to Build Families and Grow Communities
						</h2>

						<h3 class="c-report__subheading mb-5">
							Children's Coalition of Aransas County, Texas
						</h3>
						
						<div class="c-wysiwyg mb-4">
							<p>
								Inspired by the fact that you only get one chance at childhood, the Children's Coalition of Aransas County completed its first year of operation providing high-quality early education for Aransas County's children. Year-round, day-long childcare frees moms and dads to work, improving the quality of life of their families and growing the local economy, and the Coastal Blend Child Development Center parenting programs help them grow as parents, benefiting the entire community.
							</p>
							<p>
								TMF's impact investors enabled us to support the center and provide seed funding to offer this community-changing program. The Children’s Coalition of Aransas County embodies purpose and courage and the power of a faithful "yes" supported by mission-driven investors.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="col-12 col-lg-6 pe-5 order-lg-1">
				<div class="c-factoid__image u-rounded-top-right">
					<img class="d-block w-100 img-fluid" src="https://tmf-fdn.org/uploads/images/Placeholders-and-graphics/giving-options.jpg" alt="">
				</div>

				<div class="c-factoid__stat mt-3">
					<img class="d-block w-100 img-fluid" src="https://tmf-fdn.org/uploads/images/Impact-Report/factoid-1.png" alt="">
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- FACTOID -->
<section class="c-block c-factoid c-block--no-padding-bottom">
	<div class="container-fluid px-0">
		<div class="row align-items-center g-0">
			<div class="col-12 col-lg-6 d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-lg-end">
				<div class="c-factoid__description end">
					<div>
						<h2 class="c-factoid__heading mb-4">
							Including Everyone in the <span class="u-font-script-alt text-secondary">Community</span>
						</h2>

						<h3 class="c-report__subheading mb-5">
							Grace United Methodist Church Palestine
						</h3>
						
						<div class="c-wysiwyg mb-4">
							<p>
								Grace Church in Palestine longs to be a place that lets in “all the wrong people,” a community rooted in God’s amazing love and grace. The church partnered with the local school district to revitalize the 9-hole golf course on church property that hadn't been cared for in years. Now, the golf course is a space for fellowship and functions as a learning lab for PISD students, welcoming schools and the community to play golf.
							</p>
							<p>
								Thanks to a loan from TMF, the former golf restaurant and bar is now a coffee shop and kitchen, licensed for commercial use and open for small food business vendors for the community to share.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="col-12 col-lg-6 ps-5">
